    <h2>What do other services publish? (re-fetched November 1, 2026)</h2>
    <p>Prices change often. Each figure below is the provider's own published price. We re-fetched every page on November 1, 2026 (about 12:58 Lagos time) and confirmed the figure on the page. Each page shows dollar signs but does not name the currency or say which country version it is, so we make no claim about which version we saw. These are vendor statements about their own services; Scout has not tested these services, and an "application" does not mean the same thing at every provider.</p>
