    <p>Two details to read before you compare. Scale.jobs' one-time page says "We don't do subscriptions" while its separate monthly page lists subscriptions, so both are shown. On the monthly page, the $199 plan shows a $99 price next to "We Find Jobs" and next to "AI Custom Resumes", so check what each plan includes on the live page.</p>
